{"code":"036690","name":"코맥스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"통신장비","sector_desc":"통신망 장비·부품. 통신사 설비 투자(5G·6G) 시기에 실적이 집중됩니다.","desc":"동사는 1968년 전자제품 제조 및 판매를 목적으로 설립되어 2000년 코스닥 시장에 상장된 스마트홈 전문기업임. 중국 천진에 생산현지법인인 천진중앙전자유한공사를 운영하고 있으며, CS 전문법인인 코맥스씨에스를 통해 전국 규모의 서비스 대응 인프라를 구축하고 있음. 스마트홈 IoT 시스템, 홈네트워크, 시큐리티, 산업용 네트워크 사업을 영위하며 국내 스마트홈 시장에서 약 33%의 점유율을 확보하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-19","n_days":298,"close":2885.0,"open":2885.0,"high":2885.0,"low":2885.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":0.0,"ma20":2885.0,"ma60":2885.0,"ma120":2885.0,"ma200":2885.0,"close_vs_ma200":0.0,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":0.0,"r2_250":0.0,"high52":2885.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":100.0,"dd_52w":0.0,"mdd_1y":0.0,"atr14_pct":85.7143,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":null,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":0.21,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":22.0,"op_margin_q":12.0219,"op_qoq":-31.25,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":320.0,"rev_yoy":3.3898,"op_trend_4q":59.0244,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-32.44,"debt_ratio":191.63,"per":null,"pbr":3.67,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":0.21,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"036690","name":"코맥스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_code":"294","sector_name":"통신장비","marc